  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to access to justice to those citizens living in the poorest remote areas or rural Nicaragua. To expand the FJR network within the structure of the Judicial Branch to bring the judicial service to the rural poor and to establish a more peaceful society. The programme is aimed at strengthening the rule of law by improving access to justice. FJR will become a network local leaders organized</narrative>
